Out-of-scope items:
-	Executing real malware or ransomware
-	Developing or distributing malicious software
-	Dynamic malware analysis in a production environment
-	Full antivirus or endpoint-detection-and-response functionality
-	Automatic removal or quarantine of malware
-	Active exploitation of vulnerable systems
-	Penetration testing systems without authorization
